---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE, countries } from '../../data';

const launchCountries = countries.filter((country) => country.priority === 'Launch');
const otherCountries = countries.filter((country) => country.priority === 'Next');
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Weekly Relocation Jobs Newsletter on Substack | Relocate Works"
  description="Learn how Relocate Works researches weekly international relocation opportunities and publishes confirmed and potential support signals on Substack. The website itself is an informational relocation resource."
  canonicalPath="/jobs/free-preview"
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero page-hero-gradient compact-hero">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <span class="eyebrow">Relocate Works newsletter</span>
        <h1>Weekly relocation job updates are published on Substack.</h1>
        <p class="lead">This website is a free relocation information library. It does not host a live job board, show active vacancies or accept applications. Read our Substack newsletter for dated job roundups and links to employers' original advertisements.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions compact-actions">
          <a class="button button-large" href={SITE.substackUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the newsletter on Substack ↗</a>
          <a class="button-ghost button-large" href="/countries">Explore country guides</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-white">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="mini-eyebrow">How to interpret the newsletter</span>
            <h2>Understand the evidence, not a sponsorship score.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
          <div class="process-card">
            <span class="icon-circle">1</span>
            <h3>Confirmed support</h3>
            <p>The specific vacancy explicitly states that visa, work-permit or international relocation support is available. The newsletter identifies exactly which type is advertised. This is not a guarantee of an offer or visa.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card">
            <span class="icon-circle">2</span>
            <h3>Potential support</h3>
            <p>Evidence suggests the employer has international-hiring capacity, but support for the individual vacancy has not been confirmed. Ask the recruiter before relying on sponsorship.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card">
            <span class="icon-circle">3</span>
            <h3>Check before applying</h3>
            <p>Vacancies and visa rules can change quickly. Reopen the original employer listing, confirm the job is still available, and review current official rules for your personal circumstances.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading centered">
          <span class="mini-eyebrow">Ten destination markets</span>
          <h2>Explore relocation planning by country</h2>
          <p>Choose a country to learn about visas, tax, salaries, healthcare, living costs and working life. Individual weekly job postings remain on Substack.</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Launch countries</h3>
        <div class="grid-3">
          {launchCountries.map((country) => (
            <a class="country-card" href={`/countries/${country.slug}`}>
              <div class="country-top"><span class="flag">{country.flag}</span><h3>{country.name}</h3></div>
              <p>{country.shortDescription}</p>
              <span class="country-link">Read relocation guide →</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
        <h3>More countries</h3>
        <div class="grid-3">
          {otherCountries.map((country) => (
            <a class="country-card" href={`/countries/${country.slug}`}>
              <div class="country-top"><span class="flag">{country.flag}</span><h3>{country.name}</h3></div>
              <p>{country.shortDescription}</p>
              <span class="country-link">Read relocation guide →</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-white">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <h2>Read the latest weekly edition</h2>
        <p>We publish job roundups on Substack, not on this website. Our guides help you understand the destination and prepare questions about a prospective offer.</p>
        <a class="button" href={SITE.substackUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Relocate Works on Substack ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
